    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Working Group for Women (WGW) celebrated International Women's Day by organising a Talk and a Panel Discussion on \"Women Protection Act\" on Tuesday, March 27, 2007. The event was immensely significant for WGW as its newly developed website was also launched on this occasion.",
